{"t":"FLEX","made":"2026-11-18 01:51","name":"Flex Ltd.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","employees":149686,"hq":"Austin, TX, United States","website":"https://www.flex.com","summary_en":"Flex Ltd. provides technology innovation, supply chain, and manufacturing solutions to data center, communications, enterprise, consumer, automotive, healthcare, industrial, and power industries in the Americas, Asia, and Europe. The company operates through three segments: Integrated Technology Solutions (ITS), Regulated Manufacturing Solutions (RMS), and Cloud and Power Infrastructure (CPI). The ITS segment offers flexible supply and manufacturing solutions for communications, including high speed networking, enterprise, and satellite communications systems, as well as lifestyle solutions comprising products across commercial, home, and personal product categories. Its RMS segment includes industrial products, such as mission critical automation, energy, and industrial infrastructure; automotive products, including compute and power electronics platforms and integrated systems; and healthcare products comprising regulated manufacturing for medical devices, drug delivery, and equipment. The CPI segment provides cloud and cooling products, such as integrated compute systems supporting power dense digital infrastructure deployments and advanced liquid cooling solutions supporting higher density, power intensive rack architectures; and power products that include utility and facility level electrical infrastructure enabling power delivery and high density rack and board level power systems. The company was formerly known as Flextronics International Ltd. and changed its name to Flex Ltd. in September 2016. Flex Ltd. was founded in 1969 and is headquartered in Austin, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Flex Ltd.는 미주, 아시아 및 유럽의 데이터 센터, 통신, 기업, 소비자, 자동차, 의료, 산업 및 전력 산업에 기술 혁신, 공급망 및 제조 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 통합 기술 솔루션(ITS), 규제 제조 솔루션(RMS), 클라우드 및 전력 인프라(CPI)의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. ITS 부문은 고속 네트워킹, 기업 및 위성 통신 시스템을 포함한 통신을 위한 유연한 공급 및 제조 솔루션뿐만 아니라 상업, 가정 및 개인 제품 카테고리 전반의 제품으로 구성된 라이프스타일 솔루션을 제공합니다. RMS 부문에는 미션 크리티컬 자동화, 에너지, 산업 인프라와 같은 산업용 제품이 포함됩니다. 컴퓨팅 및 전력 전자 플랫폼과 통합 시스템을 포함한 자동차 제품; 의료 기기, 약물 전달 및 장비에 대한 규제 제조로 구성된 건강 관리 제품. CPI 부문은 전력 밀도가 높은 디지털 인프라 배포를 지원하는 통합 컴퓨팅 시스템과 더 높은 밀도, 전력 집약적인 랙 아키텍처를 지원하는 고급 액체 냉각 솔루션과 같은 클라우드 및 냉각 제품을 제공합니다. 전력 공급을 가능하게 하는 유틸리티 및 시설 수준 전기 인프라와 고밀도 랙 및 보드 수준 전력 시스템을 포함하는 전력 제품입니다. 이 회사는 이전에는 Flextronics International Ltd.로 알려졌습니다. Flex Ltd.는 1969년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 오스틴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":71.32,"mcap":26349944832.0,"pe":25.654676,"fpe":9.093123,"peg":null,"ps":0.8512614,"pb":4.5374727,"ev_ebitda":13.892,"div":0.0,"beta":1.787,"hi52":166.86,"lo52":53.07},"fin":{"rev":30954000384.0,"rev_g":0.248,"eps_g":0.346,"gross":0.09669,"op":0.053239997,"net":0.0335,"roe":0.19128999,"fcf":620374976.0,"cash":3083000064.0,"debt":5983000064.0,"de":103.031,"eps":2.78,"feps":7.84329},"own":{"short":0.025999999,"inst":0.9761,"insider":0.00599},"analyst":{"n":10,"mean":154.4,"median":155.0,"high":180.0,"low":128.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.27273,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":8,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":8,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":8,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":8,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-12","Firm":"Freedom Capital Markets","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":150.0,"priorPriceTarget":150.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-12","Firm":"Keybanc","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":128.0,"priorPriceTarget":180.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lo